---
source: crates/hub/tests/explain.rs
expression: report
---
projects by id
Bitmap Heap Scan on projects
  Bitmap Index Scan using projects_pkey [Index Cond: (id = ANY (?::text[]))]

swimlanes by id
Bitmap Heap Scan on swimlanes
  Bitmap Index Scan using swimlanes_pkey [Index Cond: (id = ANY (?::text[]))]

tenants of the swimlanes
Limit
  Sort
    Bitmap Heap Scan on swimlane_tenants
      Bitmap Index Scan using swimlane_tenants_pkey [Index Cond: (swimlane_id = ANY (?::text[]))]

sentinels by vm
Bitmap Heap Scan on sentinels
  Bitmap Index Scan using sentinels_vm_key [Index Cond: (vm = ANY (?::text[]))]

projects not in the file
Limit
  Index Only Scan using projects_pkey on projects [Filter: (id <> ALL (?::text[]))]

swimlanes not in the file
Limit
  Index Only Scan using swimlanes_pkey on swimlanes [Filter: (id <> ALL (?::text[]))]

sentinels not in the file
Limit
  Index Only Scan using sentinels_vm_key on sentinels [Filter: (vm <> ALL (?::text[]))]

project update
ModifyTable on projects
  Index Scan using projects_pkey on projects [Index Cond: (id = ?::text)]

swimlane update
ModifyTable on swimlanes
  Index Scan using swimlanes_pkey on swimlanes [Index Cond: (id = ?::text)]

sentinel update
ModifyTable on sentinels
  Index Scan using sentinels_vm_key on sentinels [Index Cond: (vm = ?::text)]
